{"id":"006e7cf553394a08","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-schwartz-zippel.md","title":"Schwartz-Zippel Lemma","display":"thm-schwartz-zippel — Schwartz-Zippel Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-schwartz-zippel","aliases":["28-thm-schwartz-zippel","Schwartz-Zippel Lemma"],"display":"thm-schwartz-zippel — Schwartz-Zippel Lemma","depends_on":["[[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma A.36; arbitrary-field sampling-set generalization","source_printed_pages":"529","source_pdf_pages":"555","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":true,"proof_status":"source-proof-and-local-generalization-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-schwartz-zippel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-schwartz-zippel</span><span>Schwartz-Zippel Lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schwartz-zippel — Schwartz-Zippel Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10115bca0ef04fef\" href=\"?note=10115bca0ef04fef\" title=\"28-df-arithmetic-circuit\">28-df-arithmetic-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Lemma A.36; arbitrary-field sampling-set generalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"529"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"555"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-local-generalization-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 为域。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb F[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb F[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> (非零多项式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"10115bca0ef04fef\" href=\"?note=10115bca0ef04fef\" title=\"28-df-arithmetic-circuit\">28-df-arithmetic-circuit</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg(p)\\leq d\">\\(\\deg(p)\\leq d\\)</span> (总次数界)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathbb F\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb F\\)</span> (有限非空抽样集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leftarrow U_{S^n}\">\\(a\\leftarrow U_{S^n}\\)</span> (独立均匀抽样点)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr_{a\\leftarrow U_{S^n}}[p(a)=0]\\leq\\frac d{|S|}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr_{a\\leftarrow U_{S^n}}[p(a)=0]\\leq\\frac d{|S|}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>逐变量归纳并条件化其余坐标即可得到总次数界；该引理支持多项式恒等测试。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Lemma A.36; arbitrary-field sampling-set generalization，印刷页 529；PDF 页 555。本条为明确标识的本地扩展，原书没有本条全部形式陈述。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>原书陈述取有限域 F=GF(q) 且 S=F。本条推广到任意域的有限非空 S：若 d≥|S|，结论由概率≤1直接得到；否则按变量数归纳，以最高非零系数 p_t 的次数≤d−t，先界系数在剩余坐标消失的概率≤(d−t)/|S|，其余情形按一元根数界≤t/|S|，相加即得 d/|S|。此论证复核了原书证明并补足本条推广。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-arithmetic-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"10115bca0ef04fef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-arithmetic-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"10115bca0ef04fef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p\\in\\mathbb F[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\setminus\\{0\\}$ (非零多项式, see [[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb F[x_1,\\ldots,x_n]\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg(p)\\leq d","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"a\\leftarrow U_{S^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr_{a\\leftarrow U_{S^n}}[p(a)=0]\\leq\\frac d{|S|}","display":true}],"bytes":1722,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"算术电路：[[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]、[[28-thm-schwartz-zippel]]、[[28-thm-valiant-permanent]]。"}],"outgoing":["10115bca0ef04fef"]}